{"id":"n81039-1-7","stage":4,"title":"팽개치다 · 摔","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81039-1-7-1","ko":"이 창고에는 무엇이 있나요?","zh":"这个仓库里有什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"창고에는","meaning":"仓库，库房","explanation":"창고：仓库，库房；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"창고","audio":"/audio/5f4ebee4ce9930e7c79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71808","senseId":"1","lemma":"창고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창고에는","audio":"/audio/d5450683546d708bd3fb.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇이","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇이","audio":"/audio/4f4c7be9c457a9adbf72.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"5f4ebee4ce9930e7","term":"창고","zh":"仓库，库房","audio":"/audio/5f4ebee4ce9930e7c79f.mp3","entryId":"71808","definition":"聚集或放置各种东西的地方。","pronunciation":["창고"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":